# spec: set_eq on the 700 sends one SETGET [1.7] [value, band] per band; each STATUS reply holds all three bands.
# source: NC 700 fw 1.8.2-11524+e0f7590, bosectl on Linux (BlueZ), notifications on (NOTES.md, NC 700 section)
device nc700
call set_eq 1 0 0
send 01 07 02 02 01 00
recv 01 07 03 0c f6 0a 01 00 f6 0a 00 01 f6 0a 00 02
send 01 07 02 02 00 01
recv 01 07 03 0c f6 0a 01 00 f6 0a 00 01 f6 0a 00 02
send 01 07 02 02 00 02
recv 01 07 03 0c f6 0a 01 00 f6 0a 00 01 f6 0a 00 02
result ok
